2. A hard cap of four years after the initial public release of Craton HSM
   Enterprise (the 0.1.0 tag, 2026-03-13), which is **2030-05-19**.

The hard cap ensures the entire 0.x series converts to Apache-2.0 no later
than 2030-05-19 regardless of how many patch releases occur in between.

